# M13 "Üç Yurt" (docs/PROTOCOL_ZONES.md §2.2, §7.3, §7.4), flow "zones_refused": an Aydor warrior in
# Ortaocak (the flows' default start zone) walks to the Kargan gate. From 40 m its label reads
# "Demirağız Geçidi" (in the closed colour), within 8 m the hint says "Demirağız yalnızca Karganlara
# açık.", walking in brings ZONE_GATE_REFUSED and the same line in the combat message area; the
# character stays in Ortaocak. Stepping out and in again (after the 3 s interval) is refused again.
# Run at 1280x720 and 1024x640 @150 % (--fixed-dt 0.0333).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m13_refused
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kapici
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
expecttext select.slot0 Ortaocak
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+zone1 1800
expecttext world.zone Ortaocak
scene expectgates 2
wait 20
screenshot 21_ortaocak_banner.png
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 400

# ---- Towards the Kargan gate: its label from 40 m ----
scene walktogate 3 22
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
scene facegate 3 12 10
wait 30
scene expectgatelabel Demirağız Geçidi
scene expectveils 2
expect world+nogatehint
screenshot 22_kargan_gate_label_closed.png

# ---- Within 8 m: the closed hint ----
scene walktogate 3 6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
scene facegate 3 10 8
wait 30
scene expectgatehint Demirağız yalnızca Karganlara açık.
screenshot 23_kargan_gate_hint_closed.png

# ---- Into the gate: refused, still in Ortaocak ----
scene walktogate 3 0
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
wait 15
scene expectzoneseen 0 0 1
scene expectzonemessage Demirağız yalnızca Karganlara açık.
scene expectcombatmessage Demirağız yalnızca Karganlara açık.
expect world+zone1+ready
scene expectnear 274.0 326.0 2.5
screenshot 24_kargan_gate_refused.png
# Standing in the gate: no second refusal.
wait 240
scene expectzoneseen 0 0 1
# Out and in again (more than 3 s later): refused once more.
scene walktogate 3 6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
scene walktogate 3 0
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
wait 15
scene expectzoneseen 0 0 2
expect world+zone1
quit
